{
  "pluginId": "yy",
  "version": "2.0.3",
  "apiVersion": 1,
  "displayName": "YY直播",
  "platformDescription": "YY 直播平台",
  "liveTypes": [
    "6"
  ],
  "entry": "index.js",
  "preloadScripts": [
    "fflate_0.8.2_umd.js",
    "lp_plugin_yy_2.0.3_danmaku.js"
  ],
  "auth": {
    "required": false,
    "credentialKinds": [],
    "supportsStatusCheck": false,
    "supportsValidation": false
  },
  "capabilities": {
    "categories": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "rooms": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "playback": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "search": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "roomDetail": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "liveState": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "shareResolve": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "danmaku": {
      "status": "available",
      "driver": "plugin_js_v1",
      "transport": "websocket",
      "protocolId": "yy_ws_binary",
      "protocolVersion": "1"
    }
  },
  "changelog": [
    "manifest 规范化：platformDescription 仅描述平台定位，登录需求改由 auth.required 与 credentialKinds 明确声明",
    "登录需求明确为不需要：该插件不声明账号凭据",
    "2.0.3:去除 setTimeout/clearTimeout 调用(JSContext 无该 API);AP 登录后改为同步发送 ChannelStreamsUpdateRequest,15s 协议级超时回退由 Host.ws.open 的 timeoutMs 与服务端空闲断连兜底",
    "2.0.2:回滚列表 URL 到 /mobyy/nav 与 rubiks-idx /nav/{id}/{parentId},修复列表出不来;补齐 fflate preload 修复取流时 zlib 解压缺失",
    "2.0.1:播放取流走 Host.ws 通用 WebSocket 桥,TARS 二进制协议、AP 登录与 ChannelStreams/GearLine 流程全部下沉到插件 JS",
    "第一次测试"
  ],
  "shareResolve": {
    "hosts": [
      "yy.com"
    ]
  },
  "hostBehavior": {
    "liveStateFailureFallback": "0",
    "externalRoomURLTemplate": "https://www.yy.com/{roomId}",
    "themeColor": "#FFCC00"
  }
}
